{
  "name": "ritz-roulette",
  "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-tts",
  "totalSeconds": 91.604,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "01",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t01",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "Would you pay one point three million pounds to a man you were sure had cheated you?",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ritz-roulette/01.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.112,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "1f08e8694b33"
    },
    {
      "id": "02",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "March twenty oh four, the Ritz casino in London.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ritz-roulette/02.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.795,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "5e24d4f6b580"
    },
    {
      "id": "03",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "A thin man in rimless glasses sits down at roulette.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ritz-roulette/03.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.047,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "5e24d4f6b580"
    },
    {
      "id": "04",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "The wheel is a standard European model: thirty-seven pockets, one green zero.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ritz-roulette/04.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.931,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "5e24d4f6b580"
    },
    {
      "id": "05",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Casinos know him as Niko Tosa.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ritz-roulette/05.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.315,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "5e24d4f6b580"
    },
    {
      "id": "06",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "He waits about six seconds, until the ball starts to slow.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ritz-roulette/06.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.882,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "5e24d4f6b580"
    },
    {
      "id": "07",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "Then he and a partner lunge in, covering up to fifteen numbers at once.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ritz-roulette/07.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.485,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "5e24d4f6b580"
    },
    {
      "id": "08",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "They hit about as often as they miss.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ritz-roulette/08.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.516,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "5f28f824bddd"
    },
    {
      "id": "09",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Sometimes thirteen times in a row.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ritz-roulette/09.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.885,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "5f28f824bddd"
    },
    {
      "id": "10",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Soon they're risking fifteen thousand pounds on one spin.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ritz-roulette/10.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.732,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "5f28f824bddd"
    },
    {
      "id": "11",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Counting earlier nights, the group is up about one point three million pounds.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ritz-roulette/11.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.448,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "5f28f824bddd"
    },
    {
      "id": "12",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "And he tells staff he'll be back tomorrow.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ritz-roulette/12.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.837,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "5f28f824bddd"
    },
    {
      "id": "13",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "The security chief studies the tapes.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ritz-roulette/13.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.815,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "5bae7c798843"
    },
    {
      "id": "14",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Six seconds, he thinks, is enough time for a hidden computer.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ritz-roulette/14.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.706,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "5bae7c798843"
    },
    {
      "id": "15",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "So the next night, police are waiting.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ritz-roulette/15.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.77,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "5bae7c798843"
    },
    {
      "id": "16",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "All three are arrested on suspicion of deception.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ritz-roulette/16.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.344,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "5bae7c798843"
    },
    {
      "id": "17",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "Officers seize four phones and a pocket computer.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ritz-roulette/17.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.647,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "5bae7c798843"
    },
    {
      "id": "18",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t05a",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Then the papers get hold of it.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ritz-roulette/18.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.079,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "f2f01e49f4bb"
    },
    {
      "id": "19",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "A laser hidden in a mobile phone, they say, wired to a tiny computer.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ritz-roulette/19.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.969,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "d7db3482996d"
    },
    {
      "id": "20",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.8,
      "text": "The laser scam.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ritz-roulette/20.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 0.949,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "d7db3482996d"
    },
    {
      "id": "21",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "But the searches find no earpiece, no wires, no timer.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ritz-roulette/21.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.137,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "4cef05314ed1"
    },
    {
      "id": "22",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "And Britain's gaming law dates back to eighteen forty-five.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ritz-roulette/22.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.013,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "4cef05314ed1"
    },
    {
      "id": "23",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "It says nothing about computers.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ritz-roulette/23.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.831,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "4cef05314ed1"
    },
    {
      "id": "24",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Police drop the case, and the Ritz has to pay.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ritz-roulette/24.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.474,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "4cef05314ed1"
    },
    {
      "id": "25",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "The three walk away with their winnings.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ritz-roulette/25.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.443,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "4cef05314ed1"
    },
    {
      "id": "26",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t07",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Here's the thing.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ritz-roulette/26.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 0.775,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "80cbb6b0af42"
    },
    {
      "id": "27",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t07",
      "gapAfter": 0.8,
      "text": "There was no laser.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ritz-roulette/27.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.23,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "80cbb6b0af42"
    },
    {
      "id": "28",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t07",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Years later, a reporter found him in Croatia.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ritz-roulette/28.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.469,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "80cbb6b0af42"
    },
    {
      "id": "29",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t07",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "He says he never used a computer.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ritz-roulette/29.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.685,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "80cbb6b0af42"
    },
    {
      "id": "30",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t07",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Just practice, on a wheel at home.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ritz-roulette/30.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.711,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "80cbb6b0af42"
    },
    {
      "id": "31",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t07",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "The weak spot was the wheel.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ritz-roulette/31.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.549,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "80cbb6b0af42"
    },
    {
      "id": "32",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t07",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "A slightly tilted wheel drops the ball at almost the same spot, spin after spin.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ritz-roulette/32.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.08,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "80cbb6b0af42"
    },
    {
      "id": "33",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t07",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "And the Ritz wheel, one expert says, was old and predictable.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ritz-roulette/33.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.29,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "80cbb6b0af42"
    },
    {
      "id": "34",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t07",
      "gapAfter": 0.8,
      "text": "Within months, the Ritz replaced every wheel.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ritz-roulette/34.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.836,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "80cbb6b0af42"
    },
    {
      "id": "35",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t08",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Casinos have one sure fix: no more bets once the ball is moving.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ritz-roulette/35.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.579,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "c5a63a492ba9"
    },
    {
      "id": "36",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t08",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "They won't use it.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ritz-roulette/36.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 0.713,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "c5a63a492ba9"
    },
    {
      "id": "37",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t08",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "So somewhere tonight, someone is still watching the ball slow down.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ritz-roulette/37.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.525,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "c5a63a492ba9"
    }
  ]
}
